102:`tools/exp06_profiles.py` + `oriented_cyl_results_assets/approved_digests.json` (null template until filled) has **three sections with separate fill times**: (i) `code` — source-closure digests of `tools.exp06_train`, `tools.exp06_finalize` (+ the shell files `tools/exp06_launch.sh`, `tools/exp06_haa_pipeline.sh` bound as files, below), `model.cylindrical_vit_oriented` + `model.xRIR_cyl_oriented`, `tools.exp06_heading`, `tools.exp06_recipe`, `tools.exp06_probe_align`, `tools.exp06_eval`, `tools.exp06_eval_launch`, `tools.exp06_haa_finetune`, `tools.exp06_haa_eval`, `tools.exp06_mirror_probe`, `tools.exp06_summarize_haa`, `tools.exp06_bootstrap`, `tools.exp06_compare`, plus the pinned exp_03 evaluator digest — **filled before any confirmatory execution** (second reviewed commit); (ii) `reused` — the exp_04 evaluator/writer closure digests and the sha256 of exp_04's and exp_05's `approved_digests.json` as they stand when exp_06 admits the reused A (and possibly B) simulated evaluations, and the exp_02 record identity (canonical `stats.json`/`summary.txt` sha256) for the legacy HAA arms — filled at the same time; (iii) `artifacts` — the `epoch_012.pth` sha256 (path, epoch), the four heading JSON sha256s, the G1 JSON sha256 — **filled after the artifacts exist** (bookkeeping commit verified by the Reviewer). **Lifecycle:** entry points write `provenance.json`; the external finalizer (`tools/exp06_finalize.py`, invoked by `tools/exp06_launch.sh` and `tools/exp06_haa_pipeline.sh` after each child) owns child-exit status, closed-log, input-revalidation and schema checks and writes `completion.json`; **completion units for HAA** are exclusive per-child directories `stage1/`, `stage2_<room>/`, `eval/<room>/` (each with its own `args.json` and `completion.json`) plus one orchestrator-owned job-level `completion.json` under `seed<s>/` after all children finish. **Legacy A/B admission branch:** the historical exp_02 runs have no `completion.json`, heading or closure records